# Copy this file to `.env.local` and fill in the value.

# Web3Forms access key — powers the brochure download form.
# 1. Go to https://web3forms.com and create a key for Info@mrlmedisystems.com
# 2. The access key arrives by email — paste it below
# 3. Restart `npm run dev` (NEXT_PUBLIC_ vars are read at build time)
#
# WHERE THE MAIL GOES: the recipient inbox is bound to the access key in the
# Web3Forms dashboard, NOT in this codebase. That is deliberate — the key is
# public (it ships in the client bundle), so allowing the page to choose the
# recipient would let anyone use your key to mail arbitrary addresses.
# To change the inbox, or to send through your own SMTP server so mail is
# delivered from @mrlmedisystems.com instead of Web3Forms' servers, configure
# it at https://web3forms.com/dashboard.
#
# This key must ALSO be set in Vercel:
#   Project → Settings → Environment Variables → NEXT_PUBLIC_WEB3FORMS_KEY
NEXT_PUBLIC_WEB3FORMS_KEY=
